  {
    "title": "ر is a tapped or rolled “r”",
    "body": "ر is a flick of the tongue tip, as in Spanish “pero”; doubled (رّ) it is rolled. Always pronounce it, also before a consonant and at the end of a word.",
    "pattern": "\\u0631",
    "examples": [
      {
        "word": "رَجُلٌ",
        "say": "RA-ju-lun",
        "en": "a man"
